  Text: |-
    This Lens recognizes places you scanned and anchors content to them. Walk up to a scanned area and look at it: its character scales in with a sparkle sound, and scales out when you walk away.
    
    The status panel shows each location's tracking state. Use Activate all to try the content without being at the real place.
